	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04r0301_girl2_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンこうかん！
ポケモンこうかん！▼
せきがいせんで
ポケモンが　いったりきたり！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T06:55:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T06:55:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモン交換！
ポケモン交換！▼
赤外線で
ポケモンが　行ったり来たり！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T09:54:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T06:55:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・はい選択
　ポケモン選択画面で条件を満たすポケモンを選択
　メッセージ表示後に、交換デモ開始</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T06:58:41" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
